<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS UNCH,FALLS TO $56-1/8 IN NY.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS UNCH,FALLS TO $56-1/8 IN NY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened unchanged at $56-1/4, but soon fell $0-1/8 to $56-1/4 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 290.31 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
